Subject: [PATCH] automotive: add boot marker

Add boot marker for boot KPI measurement

Change-Id: Ib3d1936ad626802d84bb0651d7e34c06a2eab7c1
Signed-off-by: Wei Li <weili@codeaurora.org>
---
